    "name": "implementing-microsegmentation-with-guardicore",
    "description": "Implements microsegmentation with Akamai Guardicore Segmentation to map application dependencies, visualize east-west traffic flows, and create granular, least-privilege network policies across VMs, containers, bare metal, and cloud. Use when blocking lateral movement in a data center or when PCI DSS/HIPAA compliance requires validated network segmentation.",
